<title>USA: American Pacific Bank sets reverse split.</title>
<headline>American Pacific Bank sets reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Pacific Bank Tuesday announced approval of a one-for-four reverse stock split. It said the split took effect May 19.</p>
<p>Each four shares of Class A common stock outstanding were converted into the right to receive one Class B common share, it said.</p>
